{"server":"jp","storyId":"act16d5_level_act16d5_05_end","groupId":"act16d5","stageId":"act16d5_05","title":"拙山","storyCode":"WR-5","avgTag":"戦闘後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/jp/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"8214dc5c9771532e183e27e3fb418cb0f77e5b49f1df20a2d678c03283af098b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"昼と夜の移り変わりがなぜか正常に戻った。墨魎も太陽を恐れなくなり、町民を襲い始めた。皆は必死で町民を守り、ウユウも意外な実力を発揮する。だが、依然として力及ばずだった。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"来るな！　来るなぁ！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ててて、手がっ、俺の手がぁ！　……は、はは、どうして全く痛くないんだ？　俺は――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"ひいっ――来ないでっ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"大丈夫か！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"遅いじゃない！！　どうして誰も鐘を叩かなかったの？　除夜の鐘を打つ僧侶はどこに行ったの！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"あなたたちを信じて言う通りにしたのに、どうして！？　どうして私の夫は死んじゃったの！？　一体どうやって……どうやって償うつもりよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……まずはここを離れるのが先決だ。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"うわあぁ――お母さん、お母さん、お母さんを返してよぉ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"うおっ！　今回も危機一髪だったね！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"お、おじさん、お母さん、お母さんが――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"小さいのを倒すだけならまだしも、外のデカいやつには歯が立たなさそうだ。お嬢ちゃん、しっかり捕まってろよ。ズラかるぞ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガァ――！　グァッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"うわっ、もう一匹来た！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"き、キリがないな！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガア――ッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"グガッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"一体どっから湧き出てやがんだ……！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"ダメだ。この数じゃ、全部は食い止めきれない――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガッ……？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"絵の中の人々とはいえ、これほどにひどい仕打ちを受けるなど……このような光景は、見ていて苦しくなる。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ラヴァ殿、ここは拙僧にお任せを。早く他の者を避難させるのだ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"サガ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"心配はご無用。拙僧はこの地を遊歴すること数年、未来への憂いや迷いも多いが――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"――目の前の危機を見過ごした事は一度もござらん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"ここは、拙僧が守り抜く。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……わかった。終わったら東に向かってくれ。そこでアタシたちと合流しよう。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"承知つかまつった！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"拙僧ここにあり！　前に進むでない！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"この境界線を越えた者は――斬る。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"うあああーーん！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"お、お、お嬢ちゃん！　髪を引っ張るのはやめてくれないか？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"お母さん――お母さん――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ガァガァガァガァうるさいなぁ。こんなにしつこく追いかけ回す頭があるならば、人の言葉くらい話してみたまえ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……ニゲ……ルナ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"うおぉ、今のは冗談だって！　なっ、なんでも真に受けないでよ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ううぅ、おじさん、前、前！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"へっ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"いやぁっ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"あ、あなたは占い師さん？　他の二人の英雄はどうしたんです？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"危ない、後ろ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"どうして化け物を連れてきたんです？　早く何とかしてください！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ええ？　私が！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"化け物を引き離してください、早く！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"い……いや私だってね――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女の子","speakerId":"avg_npc_142","isRemote":false,"text":"ううぅ、うわあぁ、お母さん、お母さん――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ、もう泣かないの！　ね？　泣かないでってば！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"あっ！　化け物がこっちを見てる！　早く、早くどうにか――"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアアアッ！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"え……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"せ、扇子で？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"……ちょっと離れていてくれるかな。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ？　ガアッ――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"]"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"一発で……！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"ガオッ！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"す、すごい……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"のおおっ！　痛ててて、手が痺れた！　こいつら一体何なんだ？　見た目はフニャフニャなのに、叩くと結構カタいじゃないか！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"はぁ……そんな目で見ないでくれたまえ。曰く、「駄獣窮して人を噛む」とな。それより早く逃げよう！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魎","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"ガアッ……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"うーん。腕前はなかなかだけどぉ、ウユウくんはこういう状況で人助けをしたことがないんだねぇ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"目の前の敵だけ倒して、周りに気を配らなかったらぁ、いつか痛い目を見ちゃうかもよぉ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"あ、あはは……。恩人様のおかげで助かりましたよ。いや本当に危ないところでした。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"……はいは〜い。早く残りの人を連れて避難してねぇ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"え、恩人様は？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"私ぃ？　大丈夫だよぉ。私は足取りが軽いから、見つかりっこないと思うよぉ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ウユウ","speakerId":"char_455_nothing","isRemote":false,"text":"（足取りが軽いとかそんなレベルの隠れ身じゃないだろ！？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"さてとぉ……一気に敵の数を減らすにはぁ――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"町民","speakerId":"avg_npc_141","isRemote":false,"text":"いやぁ！　あ、あの庭園の火はなに？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_town"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"おう！　火の柱が天に向かって伸びておる、なんと壮観な眺めか！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"サガ","speakerId":"char_362_Saga","isRemote":false,"text":"む？　そうか。たしか「ラヴァ」というのは、異国の言葉で――"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"…………"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"ラヴァちゃ〜ん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"……クルース、付近の敵の分布範囲を確認してくれ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"そんな大掛かりなのをやるつもりなのぉ？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。周りの建物が心配で、みだりに派手なアーツは使わなかったんだが……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"敵が多すぎる。ちまちま対処してたら、計り知れない数の被害者が出るだろうから。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"そうだねぇ。緊急事態には、緊急手段を――だよねぇ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"私は高いところに行くから、安心してやっていいよぉ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"アーツの範囲外にいる敵は私に任せてねぇ。一匹も取りこぼさないからぁ～。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"ああ。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"任務報告はアタシが出そう……元々ロドスが助けるべき対象は、感染者だけにとどまらない。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"ラヴァ","speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","isRemote":false,"text":"どうした？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"ううん……なんでもないよぉ。あ、その前にねぇ、ラヴァちゃん。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"クルース","speakerId":"avg_npc_144","isRemote":false,"text":"煮傘さんは見かけたぁ？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1011_purgatory","aliases":["ラヴァ"]},{"speakerId":"char_362_Saga","aliases":["サガ"]},{"speakerId":"char_455_nothing","aliases":["ウユウ","墨魎"]}]}
